  "_unmapped_note": "All other instruments (sitar, oud, kora, sarod, mbira, kalimba, balafon, marimba, vibraphone, glockenspiel, xylophone, gongs, cymbals, koto, gayageum, geomungo, sho_mouth_organ, hulusi, khaen, bawu, sheng, bagpipes including highland_bagpipes/uilleann_pipes/biniou/gaida_bulgarian/etc., harps including celtic_harp/concert_harp/arpa_jarocha/arpa_llanera/kora, dulcimer family, autoharp, jug_inst, kazoo, ensemble jazz/marching/big band, gamelan ensembles, etc.) intentionally have no emoji mapping \u2014 they fall through to family-color swatch. Their cultural / visual identity is not adequately served by the Unicode emoji set.",
